-- k095.
#ASSERT `Am I entitled to a rebate or deferment of the rates on my home` `as the ratepayer` `k095: Jake at 67, on the Age Pension with a pensioner concession card` `k095: Jake's Cockburn Central strata apartment, sole owner` FALSE FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Am I entitled to a rebate or deferment of the rates on my home` `as the ratepayer` `k095: Jake at 67, on the Age Pension with a pensioner concession card` `k095: Jake's Cockburn Central strata apartment, sole owner` FALSE FALSE EQUALS (`yes if` (`Am I entitled to a rebate or deferment` `k095: Jake at 67, on the Age Pension with a pensioner concession card` `k095: Jake's Cockburn Central strata apartment, sole owner` FALSE FALSE))
