#ASSERT `Can the passage of time stop the deferred charges being recovered` `as the buyer or executor` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Can the passage of time stop the deferred charges being recovered` `as the ratepayer` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Can the passage of time stop the deferred charges being recovered` `as the partner` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

